From: Aurélien Pommel <aurelien.pommel@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] adbd: report the Miyoo Flip

The Debian port has no property service and fills the connection banner
with a Nexus 4's values.
---
--- a/core/adbd/adb.c
+++ b/core/adbd/adb.c
@@ -302,9 +302,9 @@
     };
     static const int num_cnxn_props = ARRAY_SIZE(cnxn_props);
     static const char *values[] = {
-        "occam",
-        "Nexus 4",
-        "mako",
+        "my355",
+        "Miyoo Flip",
+        "my355",
     };
     int i;
     size_t remaining = bufsize;
